  <event id="94">
      <start>14:45</start>
      <duration>00:45</duration>
      <room>AW1.125</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Creating a nice view into the Debian archives</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talks presents an overview over the code running behind &lt;a href=&#34;http://packages.debian.org/&#34;&gt;packages.debian.org&lt;/a&gt; (and &lt;a href=&#34;http://packages.ubuntu.com/&#34;&gt;packages.ubuntu.com&lt;/a&gt;), its history, its design, its problems, and its future.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Finally it will include a short introduction on how to hack on the code to improve it.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="941">Frank Lichtenheld</person>
      </persons>
